                                "sense_id": "3515afcc-1850-3632-ae58-11d6dff57faa",
                                "text": "'Not a drop of perspiration on his face,' Ned had commented, 'and in the tropics now no one wears a topee, except certain regiments, and Peter the Planter's type of topee blows off in anything over a five-knot breeze.'"
                            }
                        ]
